    "dateLine": "12:30 p.m. Tuesday, October 6, 2026",
    "excerpt": "Following a cloudy, cool, damp and dreary Sunday, the first full week of October kicked off on a mostly sunny, breezy and pleasant note with high temperatures in the upper 60s to low 70s Monday afternoon. A high pressure system of Canadian origin has since settled into the Commonwealth and caused winds to subside behind last evening's cold frontal passage. …",
